## solution

#### using two pointers

```js
const tokenReplace = (s, tokens) => {
  let output = [];

  let i = 0;
  let j = 1;
  while (i < s.length) {
    if (s[i] !== '$') {
      output.push(s[i]);
      i += 1;
      j = i + 1;
    } else if (s[j] !== '$') {
      j += 1;
    } else {
      const key = s.slice(i, j + 1);
      output.push(tokens[key]);
      i = j + 1;
      j = i + 1;
    }
  }

  return output.join('');
};
```

- n = length of string
- Time: O(n)
- Space: O(n)

